<view class="page with-tabs"><view class="eyebrow">煦食 · 本地版</view><view class="title">留住自己的味道</view><view class="subtitle">{{recipes}} 道菜谱 · {{meals}} 顿餐。数据只在当前设备，不会自动同步。删除小程序或清理数据前，请先备份。</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" role="alert">{{error}}</view>
 <view class="card"><view class="section-title">导出备份</view><view class="muted">JSON 格式，可与原 H5 版互相导入。</view><button class="primary" hover-stay-time="80" bindtap="exportFile" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">导出备份文件</button><button class="text-button" bindtap="copy">复制备份文本</button></view>
 <view class="card"><view class="section-title">从备份恢复</view><button class="secondary" hover-stay-time="80" bindtap="chooseFile">从微信文件选择 JSON</button><label class="label">或粘贴完整备份</label><textarea class="textarea" value="{{importText}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="-1" placeholder="粘贴原 H5 或煦食导出的 JSON" bindfocus="focus" bindblur="blur" cursor-spacing="36" aria-label="备份 JSON 内容"/><button class="primary" hover-stay-time="80" bindtap="restore" disabled="{{busy || !importText}}" loading="{{busy}}">恢复备份</button></view>
 <view class="section-title">数据恢复工具</view><button class="text-button" bindtap="raw">复制未经处理的原始记录</button><button class="text-button" bindtap="previous">复制上次导入前的副本</button><button class="text-button" bindtap="resetMeta">重置阅读位置与草稿</button><view class="muted small">链接只作为收藏保存；本版没有自动解析、账号同步、公开分享菜谱或云端数据库。</view>
</view><app-tabs wx:if="{{!keyboard}}" active="library"/>
